I'd just like to point out that not everyone knows how to get the
maximum number of wishes from a wand. To me the whole point of nethack
is becoming more experienced yourself since your characters die
constantly, so that you know how to utilize enough little tricks like
wand recharging to beat the game. And long before I ascended, I found
a wand of wishing or two. Being fairly new to the game I didn't know
the tricks of the trade when it came to wishing and picked up a pair
of +o speed boots, and spellbook of identify. Did I ascend? Of course
not, because I was not experienced enough to use what I found to my
full potential. If someone knows enough about nethack to use a WoW to
it's maximum potential, they deserve to recieve the help it provides,
it doesn't mean they will just ascend effortlessly.

